    "detailed_description": "Put Official version in Wishlist now\uff01<br><br><br><br>Backrooms:Beyond one year(Prologue) is a individual prologue about official version \u300aBackrooms:Beyond one year\u300b<br>You can play a small part of content in official version here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/160ec91630774cc94a8737a940998e72.poster.avif?t=1729574134\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/160ec91630774cc94a8737a940998e72.webm?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/160ec91630774cc94a8737a940998e72.mp4?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Since Backrooms became known to the world, within a year, a large number of companies, groups, and wanderers have been seeking opportunities to enter the Backrooms, searching for treasures, occupying land, and obtaining huge profits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/9d04bf71aa4368469b1c0a1096b1081a.poster.avif?t=1729574134\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/9d04bf71aa4368469b1c0a1096b1081a.webm?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/9d04bf71aa4368469b1c0a1096b1081a.mp4?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>the player is an individual wanderer, entering the back room through the emerging company - Wanderer Union Limited. In the midst of mystery and danger, they collect supplies, establish outposts, and earn profits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/ed26f01e7955c02c0480e7ec02b21acd.poster.avif?t=1729574134\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/ed26f01e7955c02c0480e7ec02b21acd.webm?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/ed26f01e7955c02c0480e7ec02b21acd.mp4?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prologue Game elements:<br><br>\u25a0 Free exploration for first 10 levels in Backrooms (there are more levels in Official version), explore and discover interesting things freely in the multi-layered open world of the backrooms!<br><br>\u25a0 Collect materials! There are many interesting garbage and treasures in the backrooms. If you can trade them in the real world, you can exchange them for a lot of money!<br><br>\u25a0 Establish an outpost! In this dangerous world, brave wanderers are needed to establish outposts, so that tired people can have a place to rest!<br><br>Thank you for playing &amp; please wishlist our official Version!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Put Official version in Wishlist now\uff01<br><br><br><br>Backrooms:Beyond one year(Prologue) is a individual prologue about official version \u300aBackrooms:Beyond one year\u300b<br>You can play a small part of content in official version here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/160ec91630774cc94a8737a940998e72.poster.avif?t=1729574134\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/160ec91630774cc94a8737a940998e72.webm?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/160ec91630774cc94a8737a940998e72.mp4?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Since Backrooms became known to the world, within a year, a large number of companies, groups, and wanderers have been seeking opportunities to enter the Backrooms, searching for treasures, occupying land, and obtaining huge profits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/9d04bf71aa4368469b1c0a1096b1081a.poster.avif?t=1729574134\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/9d04bf71aa4368469b1c0a1096b1081a.webm?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888730/extras/9d04bf71aa4368469b1c0a1096b1081a.mp4?t=1729574134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>the player is an individual wanderer, entering the back room through the emerging company - Wanderer Union Limited. In the midst of mystery and danger, they collect supplies, establish outposts, and earn profits!<br><br><span cla